CASH FORECAST SUMMARY:
Closing cash falls from the Q4 peak of 13.52 million in December to a low of 5.02 million in April 2027 as stock for the spring season is bought.
External financing of 3.5 million (1.5 million in March, 2.0 million in April) is needed to keep closing cash above the 5 million minimum liquidity floor.
